        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Candace Flynn, Ashley Tisdale, Dan Povenmire\n- Products: Phineas and Ferb, The Suite Life of Zack & Cody\n- Organizations: Disney Channel\n- Roles: main character, voice actor, creator, designer\n\nFacts:\n- Candace Gertrude Flynn is a main character in the Disney Channel animated television series \"Phineas and Ferb.\"\n- Dan Povenmire created and designed Candace Flynn for \"Phineas and Ferb.\"\n- Ashley Tisdale voices Candace Flynn in \"Phineas and Ferb.\"\n- Ashley Tisdale achieved mainstream success as Maddie Fitzpatrick in the Disney Channel series \"The Suite Life of Zack & Cody.\"",
